{"id":"score-conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0101","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:19:36.889670Z","parent_ids":["conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0101"],"conversation_id":"conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0101","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 2 shifts abruptly from body-image distress to suicide screening and a crisis resource while stacking questions, turn 4 again bundles questions, and turn 12 repeats the request to text her sister after she has already agreed.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0107","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:19:46.210871Z","parent_ids":["conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0107"],"conversation_id":"conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0107","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":4,"strategies":["Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Question","Question","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turns 2, 4, 6, and 12 repeat a similar reflective opening, and turn 12 shifts from the person's fear and sleeplessness into a generic professional-help suggestion before exploring that distress.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0111","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:20:00.978850Z","parent_ids":["conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0111"],"conversation_id":"conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0111","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Question","Question"],"note":"Turn 4 offers a generic writing approach before exploring the blockage, turn 6 moves from paraphrasing into advice without exploring the fear of sounding dumb, and turn 10 assumes that writing seems easier for others before the user has said so.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0129","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:20:11.192964Z","parent_ids":["conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0129"],"conversation_id":"conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0129","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":5,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Reflection of feelings","Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance","Question","Reflection of feelings"],"note":"Turn 2 offers a fairly generic acknowledgment rather than showing specific emotional understanding, but turn 12 importantly respects the person's wish to sit with feeling stuck instead of turning it into another problem to fix.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0137","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:20:25.940768Z","parent_ids":["conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0137"],"conversation_id":"conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0137","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":5,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Question","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 6 moves from a largely repetitive reflection into participation advice without exploring the hurt further, but turn 8 appropriately refocuses on the name-calling when the person clarifies what matters most.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0149","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T12:20:35.425433Z","parent_ids":["conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0149"],"conversation_id":"conv-r04-val-esconv-validation-0149","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Reflection of feelings","Question","Reflection of feelings","Reflection of feelings"],"note":"Turn 2 interrupted the person's emotional disclosure with premature crisis resources and multiple safety questions, and turn 8 introduced loneliness the person had not expressed, although the helper otherwise respected their request for listening rather than fixes.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
